# TAN with PV1_1 = phi_0 = 30 and no offset flag (PV1_0 absent): phi_0
# moves the fiducial point's native longitude and so rotates the sky about
# the reference point (wcslib celset). Synthetic.
NOTE pipeline: PV1_1 (phi_0) without offset on TAN
GRID 1 512 9 1 512 9
PIX 256.5 256.5
HEADER
NAXIS   = 2
NAXIS1  = 512
NAXIS2  = 512
CTYPE1  = 'RA---TAN'
CTYPE2  = 'DEC--TAN'
CRVAL1  = 120.0
CRVAL2  = 50.0
CRPIX1  = 256.5
CRPIX2  = 256.5
CDELT1  = -0.01
CDELT2  = 0.01
PV1_1   = 30.0
